---
id: AD-Manajerial-JadwalShiftOverride
title: Activity Diagram - Manajerial Jadwal Pegawai dan Shift Override
---
flowchart TD
  A([Mulai]) --> B[HR/Super Admin buka menu Manajerial]
  B --> C{Fitur}

  C -- Kelola Jadwal Pegawai --> D[Lihat jadwal pegawai]
  D --> E{Aksi jadwal}
  E -- Create --> F[Tambah jadwal pegawai]
  E -- Update --> G[Ubah jadwal]
  E -- Delete --> H[Hapus jadwal]
  E -- Generate --> I[Generate jadwal otomatis]
  F --> D
  G --> D
  H --> D
  I --> D

  C -- Kelola Shift Override --> J[Lihat data override]
  J --> K{Aksi override}
  K -- Create --> L[Tambah override]
  K -- Update --> M[Ubah override]
  K -- Delete --> N[Hapus override]
  K -- Bulk Create --> O[Upload/input massal override]
  L --> J
  M --> J
  N --> J
  O --> J

  C -- Selesai --> Z([Selesai])
